title:loadPhase
---
//when we declare new variable VSCode automatically designates a type, there's no need to hand-code a type.
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>
<<dialogPhaseSetter NPC>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
<<jump quest_taken>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken_return">>
<<jump quest_taken_return>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "repeat">>
<<jump repeat>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "repeat_return">>
<<jump repeat_return>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete">>
<<jump quest_complete>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
<<jump quest_complete_return>>
<<else>>
Erling Haaland: I don't know what to do. This is an error debug message. Fix your shit.
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
<<set $visitedYet = true>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: Hello there! I am Erling Haaland.
Erling Haaland: Welcome to the Erling Haaland and Jude Bellingham house.
Erling Haaland: Jude Bellingham is not here right now but that is okay.
Erling Haaland: He is definitely in England with the boys.
Erling Haaland: I miss him dearly.
Erling Haaland: We are like family but more than family but not just bros we are more than bros..
Erling Haaland: If that makes sense.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Makes sense to me.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: You must be wondering about the decorations.
Erling Haaland: I am in the middle of setting up for Jude Bellingham's gabber night of fun.
Erling Haaland: As a welcome back from his time playing for England.
Erling Haaland: While you're here, I actually need you to help me with something important.
Erling Haaland: Let's say... essential to gabber night of fun.
Erling Haaland: Can you help me?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->I can help.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_taken">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
        <<jump quest_taken>>
    ->Not right now.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "repeat">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: repeat
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: Can you help me?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Sure.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "repeat">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
        <<jump quest_taken>>
    -> Not right now.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: quest_taken
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: Ah this is great!
Erling Haaland: I am hosting a huge night of gabber fun, as I said.
Erling Haaland: But I am missing Joost Klein.
Erling Haaland: You know, the dutch guy.
Erling Haaland: The spirit of Netherlands itself.
Erling Haaland: We cannot have gabber night of fun without THE Joost.
Erling Haaland: I haven't heard from him and I am worried he got stuck somewhere.
Erling Haaland: I need you to go find him for me.
Erling Haaland: Make sure he is all in one piece.
Erling Haaland: As I am stuck in this room and can't really leave like you can.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Where should I look for him?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: He might be in the weird maze outside the house.
Erling Haaland: You know...
Erling Haaland: The maze I made with Jude Bellingham.
Erling Haaland: It's like we built a snowman together or something...
Erling Haaland: But anyway-- pwetty pwease???
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Well.. what's in it for me?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: If you bring him back to me I'll give you a VIP ticket.
Erling Haaland: To the gabber party of course.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Sure.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_taken_return">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Not right now.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "repeat_return">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
        <<jump repeat_return>>
===

title: repeat_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: Can you please just find Joost for me dude ughhhh.
    -> Fine.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_taken_return">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: quest_taken_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
Erling Haaland: Welcome back my little chudling! Did you find Joost Klein?
    -> Nope.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: quest_complete
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: Joost Klein!
Erling Haaland: You have found him!
Erling Haaland: The gabber party is saved!
Erling Haaland: Jude Bellingham will be so happy
Erling Haaland: Thanks for bringing me the dutch guy.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Of course. I'm happy to help hehe
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: You're amazeballs.
Erling Haaland: As promised -- your VIP ticket.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> *grabs crisp yellow VIP ticket*
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: There will be snacks, drinks..
Erling Haaland: ...
Erling Haaland: More snacks.
Erling Haaland: As you can see me and Jude Bellingham only need three things.
Erling Haaland: Soccer.
Erling Haaland: Snacks and drinks.
Erling Haaland: And dutch men.
Erling Haaland: Technically that's four things but .. WHATEVER BRO. 
Erling Haaland: Enjoy the party 
Erling Haaland: Pookie.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Love you king.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_complete_return">>
===

title: quest_complete_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Erling Haaland: You've saved the Jude Bellingham Welcome Home Gabber Party!
Erling Haaland: Thanks again friend.
Erling Haaland: Fruit punch is on the table.
Erling Haaland: Or was.
Erling Haaland: IDK who took it.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===